{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hearbeat rate will rise with\u00a0<strong>Super Headblaster</strong>,\u00a0an improbable mix of Crank and Akira. Experience frenetic action on this colorful and stylish 2D arcade game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player action:</strong> run through the city fetching weird pills to keep your headache at bay.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destruction:</strong>\u00a0as your headache gets more intense, you become stronger and faster! Destroy your pursuers and parts of the city while you are powerful, but beware to not reach your limit! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenetic pursuit:</strong>\u00a0be on your guard, the Special Contention Unit will be trying to capture you at all costs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups:</strong>\u00a0some items can give you a temporary advantage, collect them all.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1928830?t=1755540821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928830/c675758ca1b23989b99c3581f9eff15065d3a861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755540821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928830/13371b484e026556a47156fa95b53f2a8c54117a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755540821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928830/13371b484e026556a47156fa95b53f2a8c54117a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755540821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hearbeat rate will rise with\u00a0<strong>Super Headblaster</strong>,\u00a0an improbable mix of Crank and Akira. Experience frenetic action on thi